eal offering shall be Aaron’s and his sons’; it is a thing most holy of Jehovah’s offerings by fire.","tok":[{"t":"And that which is "},{"t":"left","s":["H3498"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the meal "},{"t":"offering","s":["H4503"],"a":[2]},{"t":" shall be "},{"t":"Aaron’s","s":["H0175"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and his "},{"t":"sons","s":["H1121"],"a":[4]},{"t":"’; it is a thing "},{"t":"most","s":["H6944"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"holy","s":["H6944"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of Jehovah’s "},{"t":"offerings","s":["H0801"],"a":[7]},{"t":" by "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0801"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"No meal offering that you present to Jehovah shall be made with leaven, for you shall not burn any leaven or any honey as an offering by fire to Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"No meal "},{"t":"offering","s":["H4503"],"a":[1]},{"t":" that you present to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":" shall be "},{"t":"made","s":["H6213"],"a":[6]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"leaven","s":["H2557"],"a":[7]},{"t":", for you shall not "},{"t":"burn","s":["H6999"],"a":[14]},{"t":" any "},{"t":"leaven","s":["H7603"],"a":[10]},{"t":" or any "},{"t":"honey","s":["H1706"],"a":[12]},{"t":" as an "},{"t":"offering","s":["H0801"],"a":[16]},{"t":" by "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0801"]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[17]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"You may present them to Jehovah, as an offering of firstfruits, but they shall not be offered up for a satisfying fragrance on the altar.","tok":[{"t":"You may present them to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":", as an "},{"t":"offering","s":["H7126"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"firstfruits","s":["H7225"],"a":[1]},{"t":", but they shall not be offered up for a satisfying fragrance on the "},{"t":"altar","s":["H4196"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"And every offering of your meal offering you shall season with salt, and you shall not omit the salt of the covenant of your God from your meal offering; with all your offerings you shall present salt.","tok":[{"